; A made-up ledger-cli journal for tests. Every name and number is invented.
# a hash comment
% a percent comment
| a bar comment
* an org-mode heading

comment
Ignored, even when it looks like a transaction:
2024/01/01 * Not read
    Assets:Checking  $1
end comment

D $1,000.00
Y2024

account Assets:Checking
    note The everyday account

commodity $
    format $1,000.00

alias checking = Assets:Checking

= /^Expenses:Food/
    (Budget:Food)  -1

~ Monthly
    Expenses:Rent  $1,000.00
    Assets:Checking

define x = 1
bucket Assets:Checking

1/5 * (1001) Paycheck ; the first one
    checking                                  $3,000.00
    Income:Salary

1/10=1/12 ! Rent
    Expenses:Rent   $1,200
    Assets:Checking   -$1,200.00

2024/01/15 Stocks
    Assets:Brokerage   10 AAPL @ $150.00
    Assets:Checking

2024.01.20 * Moving money, virtually
    [Assets:Savings]   $100
    [Assets:Checking]  $-100
    (Budget:Fun)   $50

apply account Assets
2024/01/25 Transfer within
    Savings     $200
    Checking
end apply account

2024/01/31 Doesn't balance
    Assets:Checking   $10
    Expenses:Misc     $5

2024/01/31 Sale
    Assets:Brokerage   -4 AAPL {$150.00} [2024/01/15] (lot note) @ $160.00
    Assets:Checking    $640.00
    Income:Capital Gains  $-40.00

P 2024/01/31 AAPL $165.00
P 2024/01/31 00:00:00 EUR $1.08
